        "original_id": "8acb451b-3a61-5689-afdd-7acbd492257e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Evil Con Carne, Grim & Evil, The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy\n- People: Maxwell Atoms\n- Companies: Cartoon Network\n- Concepts: spin-offs, sister shows, Cartoon Cartoons\n\nFacts:\n- Evil Con Carne is an American animated series that was created by Maxwell Atoms.\n- Evil Con Carne is a spin-off of Grim & Evil and a sister show of The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy.\n- The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy is an American animated television series created by Maxwell Atoms for Cartoon Network.\n- The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy is also known as Billy & Mandy.\n- The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy is considered the 14th Cartoon Cartoon on Cartoon Network because of its earlier inclusion in Grim & Evil.\n- The Cartoon Cartoons brand had been temporarily discontinued earlier in June 2003, although some still consider The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy a Cartoon Cartoon show.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
